&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited about working in a fast-paced, high-growth environment and passionate about Finance, this opportunity is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a highly motivated and detail-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Senior Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Finance team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll take ownership of the group&#39;s most complex accounting topics: with a strong focus on &lt;strong&gt;monthly reporting, group consolidation,&amp;nbsp; year-end procedures and audit readiness &lt;/strong&gt;across our multi-entity European structure, while keeping the bigger picture in view at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be the go-to expert and sparring partner for demanding accounting and reporting topics, helping us maintain the highest standards in financial accuracy, compliance, and transparency across all entities. With your structured mindset and hands-on approach, you&#39;ll own complex processes end-to-end and contribute to a Finance team that runs its processes smoothly and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;group consolidation&lt;/strong&gt; process in Lucanet: eliminating intercompany differences, managing eliminations, and ensuring our consolidated financial data is consistent and audit-ready across all entities at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle&lt;strong&gt; intercompany accounting&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end: including reconciliation and clear documentation of intercompany flows across the group&#39;s European entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review &lt;strong&gt;complex accrual calculations, &lt;/strong&gt;provisions and cost accruals, ensuring completeness and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;AP &amp;amp; AR clean-up projects,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;identifying aged items, mispostings, and open reonciling items, and working cross-functionally to resolve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;transfer pricing,&lt;/strong&gt; preparing transfer pricing documentation in collaboration with our external tax advisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;sparring partner for our external auditors&lt;/strong&gt;, handling audit queries and coordinating documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;monthly reporting cycle&lt;/strong&gt; by reviewing journal entries, reconciliations, and intercompany positions: catching issues early and ensuring consistency across the group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the preparation of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;standalone and consolidated financial statements&lt;/strong&gt; in accordance with German GAAP (HGB).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Of course, you will also:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Finance team to support a smooth and efficient year-end closing process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously look for ways to improve and automate consolidation, reporting, and documentation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cross-functional initiatives that elevate the quality and scalability of our Finance operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closely collaborate with Billing and FP&amp;amp;A functions to ensure clean and accurate financial data, forming a strong basis for reliable reporting and audit readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know, sometimes, you can&#39;t tick every box. We would still love to hear from you if you think you&#39;re a good fit!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced &amp;amp; Reliable:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring 3-4 years of experience in (group) accounting, financial reporting, or audit. Experience at a Big 4 firm is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert in Group Accounting &amp;amp; Consolidation:&lt;/strong&gt; You have solid, hands-on knowledge of HGB (German GAAP), group consolidation, month end close. You&#39;re comfortable owning these processes end-to-end in a multi-entity environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-Oriented, and Big-Picture Aware:&lt;/strong&gt; You take pride in getting the details right, but you also understand how individual accounting tasks connect to the broader financial reporting landscape. You use that perspective to prioritise, flag risks early, and add value beyond the immediate task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reviewing Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy working through financial data and outputs with a critical, structured eye: identifying gaps and inconsistencies in a constructive, collaborative way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool-Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve worked with tools like Lucanet and DATEV and feel confident navigating finance systems to streamline your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicator &amp;amp; Sparring Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re proactive and confident working with colleagues, external auditors, and tax advisors, and you enjoy being a thought partner, not just an executor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re fluent in English and comfortable using it in meetings, reporting, and documentation. German is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You hold a degree in Finance, Accounting, or a related field and are motivated to grow in a dynamic, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our offering&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something that matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Hive is redefining commerce operations in a €200B+ market. We already reach tens of millions of consumers a year and power 600+ independent brands, and we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with exceptional people:&lt;/strong&gt; a high-performing, ambitious team, many from McKinsey, Amazon, Shopify, Google, TikTok, and Trade Republic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow with Hive:&lt;/strong&gt; own impactful projects from day one and grow as we scale. We&#39;re a meritocracy: your impact drives your progression, not your past titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/strong&gt; 30 vacation days a year, plus a paid 20-day sabbatical every three years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; market-competitive salary and an equity incentive plan (EIP) for all full-time team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your setup, your choice:&lt;/strong&gt; a MacBook (or laptop of your choice) plus accessories like an extra monitor or headphones, and a €46/month productivity budget to spend how you work best (from month 4; €23 for interns and working students from month 3).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food and fitness:&lt;/strong&gt; free lunch once per week at the Berlin office + daily 50% subsidy on lunch by ChefCoco, free drinks and snacks, and a €20/month Urban Sports Club subsidy for full-time team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility and connection:&lt;/strong&gt; flexible working hours, internal training led by Hive experts, regular team events (€30/person/month budget), and company-wide multi-day offsites that bring all of Hive together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extras:&lt;/strong&gt; partner discounts on Raus stays, gym platforms, and a corporate benefits portal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re revolutionizing e-commerce operations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;At Hive, we empower brands to excel in the digital commerce era through our innovative operations platform. By combining cutting-edge technology with a curated network of top-tier operations partners, we deliver measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Our comprehensive platform streamlines the entire operational chain through a single, intuitive interface. Since our founding in 2020, we&#39;ve rapidly grown to become one of Europe&#39;s leading operations platform, partnering with hundreds of innovative brands. With strategic locations in Berlin, Paris, Milan, Madrid, London, and Amsterdam. Backed by prestigious investors including Tiger Global, Earlybird, and Picus Capital, we&#39;re scaling our impact across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Diversity and inclusion are core to our success. We actively cultivate an environment where every team member, regardless of background, can thrive. We welcome talent from all walks of life, regardless of religion, ethnicity, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, or disability. At Hive, authenticity and professional growth go hand in hand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Total Compensation Range: €72,930 - €104,550&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BER3 is our Berlin flagship - and the site where we pilot the processes, tools, and automation that later scale across the whole Hive network. We&#39;re looking for a Site Lead to own it end-to-end: its people, its performance, its P&amp;amp;L, and its standard of excellence. You&#39;ll run a site of ~200 associates across all different areas leading through a team of Area Managers. This is a hands-on leadership role - you set the standard on the floor, not from a desk. You&#39;re first in and last out when it matters, calm under pressure, and you turn problems into proposals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own&lt;/strong&gt; the building end-to-end. Take full accountability for BER3&#39;s P&amp;amp;L, productivity, quality, safety and team health.&amp;nbsp;Hitting monthly, quarterly and annual budget targets and treating every cost line and KPI as yours. Flag deviations early with a plan, not a surprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run&lt;/strong&gt; safe, high-quality daily operations. Keep associates safe and compliant as your first priority. Own order accuracy, customer NPS and health scores. Be visible on the floor, regular Gemba walks, shift-start presence during peaks, and time close to the work and the merchants you serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; and grow people. Coach your Area Managers with weekly 1:1s, clear growth paths and honest, regular feedback. Build a skills matrix, develop successors, and manage performance in line with our value of caring meritocracy. Keep a motivated team and low churn of your best people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt; improvement and innovation. BER3 is Hive&#39;s R&amp;amp;D site, so you&#39;ll run it with a try-fast, learn-fast mindset, piloting new processes, tools and automation, and turning what works at BER3 into improvements that ship across the network. Bring at least one measurable improvement initiative per quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and collaborate&lt;/strong&gt;. Write clearly (SOPs, incident post-mortems), present with structure (leadership reviews, all-hands), and own escalations end-to-end: including a fast, structured response on critical (SEV1) incidents. Partner with HQ, the WMS/product team, and merchant-facing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Several years&lt;/strong&gt; leading a fulfillment center, warehouse or 3PL operation at scale, with direct P&amp;amp;L ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A genuine hands-on&lt;/strong&gt;, people-first leadership style and a never-give-up attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical skills&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortable with data, able to read a P&amp;amp;L and act on it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proactive, solution-first problem-solver &lt;/strong&gt;who surfaces issues early and brings suggestions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proven track record &lt;/strong&gt;of building and developing teams, and of working with a diverse, multicultural workforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English&lt;/strong&gt;; German is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have: &lt;/strong&gt;Lean / Six Sigma or similar continuous-improvement experience; familiarity with WMS systems and an interest in automation/AI in fulfillment; experience standing up new processes or sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
