&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hive is scaling to become Europe’s default operating system for commerce, and our Growth engine is at the heart of that ambition. We’re looking for an exceptional Founder Associate / Strategy Associate to our Chief Growth Officer to sit at the nerve center of that engine for 6 months, own problems that would normally land on a McKinsey Engagement Manager’s desk, and actually ship the answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a zero-to-one internship. You’ll work shoulder-to-shoulder with our CGO on the highest-leverage questions Hive is facing: market entries, pricing architecture, GTM motion redesigns, and the board-level narratives behind them. You won’t fetch coffee. You’ll build the models, drive the analyses, and present the recommendations that shape where Hive goes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re the person who excelled at a top program, cracked the McKinsey case-prep circuit, and now wants 4-6 months of real operator exposure before you take the BCG/McKinsey/Bain offer, or before you start the venture you’ve already been sketching out, this role was built for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the CGO’s force multiplier. Every week, you’ll turn an ambiguous, high-stakes strategic question into a crisp, defensible answer, and then help make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own CGO-level strategic projects end-to-end: &lt;/strong&gt;from framing the problem, to structuring the analysis, to landing the recommendation with the leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the models: &lt;/strong&gt;unit economics, pricing simulations, cohort analyses, market sizings, and business cases for new market entries and product bets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run deep-dive analyses across our commercial funnel: &lt;/strong&gt;pipeline health, segment performance, sales productivity, churn drivers, and turn findings into concrete interventions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare board, investor, and all-hands materials &lt;/strong&gt;with the CGO, the kind of decks that get pressure-tested in front of Tiger Global, Earlybird, and Picus Capital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and run strategic experiments &lt;/strong&gt;with Sales, Account Management, Marketing, and Partnerships, and measure what actually moved the needle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthesize competitive and market intelligence into decisions: &lt;/strong&gt;how Hive positions against Shopify, Amazon, 3PLs, and category entrants across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as chief of staff to the CGO: &lt;/strong&gt;driving the weekly operating rhythm, prioritizing the inbox and calendar, and ensuring nothing important drops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A distinctive academic track record: &lt;/strong&gt;Dean’s List, scholarships, or thesis awards are strong signals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting-track pedigree: &lt;/strong&gt;you’ve prepped seriously for McKinsey, BCG, or Bain interviews. You think in MECE, you’re analytically ruthless in Excel, and you can structure a slide in your sleep&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prior exposure at the highest bar: &lt;/strong&gt;internships at MBB, top VC-backed scaleups (Trade Republic, N26, Revolut, Flix, Sennder), PE, or IB. Founder or founding-team experience is a huge plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytically ruthless, commercially sharp: &lt;/strong&gt;you can go from a messy Metabase export to a board-ready insight in an afternoon.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;SQL or Python is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operator instincts, not just analyst instincts: &lt;/strong&gt;you don’t stop at the recommendation; you drive execution and carry things across the finish line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional written and verbal English (C1+); German is a strong plus &lt;/strong&gt;given our large DACH footprint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency, low ego: &lt;/strong&gt;you move fast, you ask the blunt question in the room, and you’d rather be useful than look good politically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available for 4-6 months starting ASAP: &lt;/strong&gt;Pflichtpraktikum, gap semester, or pre-MBA window all work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proximity to the decision table: &lt;/strong&gt;you’ll sit in every meeting that matters, strategy, board prep, exec offsites, investor updates. Most people don’t get this exposure until their late 20s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A resume line you can’t buy: &lt;/strong&gt;Founder / Strategy Associate to the CGO of one of DACH’s top-scaling scaleups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A guaranteed conversion path: &lt;/strong&gt;top performers get a full-time offer into Strategy, BizOps, Chief of Staff, or a GTM leadership track, with a clear 2-year path to running a function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with exceptional people: &lt;/strong&gt;our team includes alumni from McKinsey, Amazon, Shopify, Google, TikTok, and Trade Republic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real autonomy from day one:&lt;/strong&gt; your impact drives your progression, not your past titles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools to thrive: &lt;/strong&gt;MacBook, Claude Pro &amp;amp; Lovable Business Plan, modern office at Alexanderplatz, 30 vacation days prorated, flexible hours, and regular team events including company-wide offsites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A front-row seat&lt;/strong&gt; to the €200B operations opportunity in European commerce&lt;/li&gt;
